// Cells, north to south: room 3 (the great mirror, Reverse's corridor), room 2 (three mirror doors,
// two mime statues), room 1 (the source's ice grid at (1, 21): ice, crystal pillars), the hall and mat.
// Room 2's wall row y 17 leaves only (6-8, 17) open: Xela, on (8, 17), sees the way to the doors. Room
// 3's exit is a mat (6-7, 10), Building 6/7 (MB_SOUTH_ARROW_WARP): pushing south leaves for the S mat.
// SilReverseCityGym (games/silice/gfx/SilReverseCityGym.ron, original art): black-mirror walls, dark
// navy floor, dark teal ice (MB_ICE), pale violet crystal pillars, upside-down chandeliers on the wall
// faces; stamps for the great mirror (5-8, 1-3), the mirror doors (their bottom row walkable, the door
// coords) and the stairs up from the ice (6, 20-21).
[
    Ascii(x: 0, y: 0, rows: [
        "MMMMMMMMMMMMMM",
        "MMMMMMMMMMMMMM",
        "MMMMMMMMMMMMMM",
        "MMMMlFFFFlMMMM",
        "MMMM......MMMM",
        "MMMMM...MMMMMM",
        "MMMMM...MMMMMM",
        "MMMMF...MMMMMM",
